"Polite Wars are regulated Questor wars fought largely through mortals."
"Davrar sends each invited fighter a formal war invitation as a blue box; joining is optional."
"A Questor can tap the air to send that blue box to another person."
"A mortal's invitation, verbatim, began: \"This is a formal Questor conflict with special rules.\""
"\"Participation is optional. You are not a Questor:\""
"\"If you die in this War, your death will be permanent. Term Summary:\""
"Then, for one mortal: \"Additional condition: if you accept, you agree not to share\""
"\"your new antimagic Insight with any other being until the War is concluded.\""
"It ended: \"Do you wish to join this Polite War on the side of the Ashen Accord?\""
"Focusing on part of the terms box opens details, such as a zoomable map of the war zone."
"The terms define doomsday artifacts and mind magic clearly, with no apparent loopholes."
"Entering the zone before the war means disqualification and undoing."
"A war's bans end when every participant has left the area, surrendered or died."
"The terms can let combatants Travel back without the normal restrictions."
"A winner may demand an Insight as a war prize."
"Davrar gives a notification at the war's start and sends kill boxes mid-battle."
"Davrar announces the end with a result box giving each fighter's contribution percentage."
"Contribution percentages are known publicly among Questors."
"Questor wars grant no levels, but ranks and Developments can still be gained in them."
"New Questors are warned not to travel alone before wars."
"Years later the Ashen Accord and Aleph Grid fought a Polite War; the Heirs fought for the Accord."
"Its terms: a wilds zone, a 10-mile start, all magic but mind magic, full elimination."
"Nathan's result box read: \"The Polite War between the Ashen Accord and the Aleph Grid\""
"\"has concluded with an Ashen Accord Victory. All terms have been upheld,\""
"\"and the consequences have been assessed.\""
"\"Congratulations on your victory and your survival!\""
"\"Your contribution percentage has been assessed at 17.43% You contributed the most\""
"\"of any combatant on either side! Davrar will verify this claim in future dealings.\""
"\"Davrar applauds your success.\""
"Sarah scored 14.26%, Stella 14.04%, Khachi 8.78% and Aarl 6.38%, six tenths of all between them."
"Winning that war gave the Heirs the right to call a Conclave."
